<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, I’m the Fishin’ Guru. Self-titled.\rI been fishin’ off this pier 30 years\nand caught a fish TWICE.\rYou want one of my Rods? I got\nlike forty. Don’t ask why. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When you wanna fish, face\nthe water and use the Rod.\rThen lock in and watch\nthe water close!\rWhen a “!” pop up, a homie\ngot on the line!\rSmash the A Button quick to\nreel it in.\rThen you’ll see wassup.\rIf there’s water, ocean or\ncreek, throw that Rod in.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">No Rod? Bro, you scared of fish?\nThey can’t even walk.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When you wanna fish, face\nthe water and use the Rod.\rThen lock in and watch\nthe water close!\rWhen a “!” pop up, a homie\ngot on the line!\rSmash the A Button quick to\nreel it in.\rThen you’ll see wassup.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What should my homie hold?\rMaybe somethin’ that pump\nup its Attack. Or a gun.\fThey make those small?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo. You pickin’ Apricorns? Say\nyes. Please. I need this. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AYYY! A FELLOW APRICORN ENJOYER!\rI’m so hype I’m givin’ you this.\nDon’t tell my wife.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Nah? You don’t pick Apricorns?\nThat’s cool. I’ll CONVERT you.\rApricorns changed my LIFE.\nTake this first. It’s a gateway.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lure Ball!\nThis Hood Ball make it easy to\frecruit the homies that bite\fwhen you go fishin’!\rIt’s made outta Apricorns, by\nthe way. Take them two, on me.\rWant more? Go to Azalea Town.\nA man named Kurt make custom\fHood Balls outta Apricorns.\rApricorns run this!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kurt the Michael Jordan of Apricorns.\nI got his poster over my bed.\rIf you hit Azalea Town, tell\nhim I said... Nah, he’ll know.\rApricorn, Apricorner, APRICORNEST!</language>
	</row>
</body>
